ill="#4C4C4C">mira</text><text x="410" y="163" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Calibri, Carlito, Segoe UI, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#4C4C4C">el resultado</text><rect x="560" y="30" width="240" height="150" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#007D81" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="680" cy="72" r="22" fill="#007D81"/><text x="680" y="80" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Calibri, Carlito, Segoe UI, sans-serif" font-size="22" fill="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold">?</text><text x="680" y="118" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Calibri, Carlito, Segoe UI, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#111111" font-weight="bold">Control</text><text x="680" y="146" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Calibri, Carlito, Segoe UI, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#4C4C4C">mira la relación</text><text x="680" y="163" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Calibri, Carlito, Segoe UI, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#4C4C4C">entre ambos</text><text x="410" y="206" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Calibri, Carlito, Segoe UI, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#4C4C4C" font-weight="bold">Cada concepto responde a una pregunta propia</text></svg><figcaption>Figura 1. Las tres preguntas. Fuente: elaboración propia.</figcaption></figure>
