</div>
<div class="vista" id="vis4-0"><p>Una la entiende como plan estratégico, esto es, el conjunto de objetivos e iniciativas con que la organización busca mejorar.</p><figure><svg viewBox="0 0 700 200" width="700" height="200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Primera lectura de la palabra estrategia: el plan estratégico, entendido como el conjunto de objetivos e iniciativas con que la organización busca mejorar."><defs><marker id="v1" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#007D81"/></marker><marker id="v2" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#4C4C4C"/></marker></defs><rect x="40" y="40" width="280" height="56" rx="8" fill="#E0F0F0" stroke="#007D81" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="180" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Calibri, Carlito, Segoe UI, sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#111111" font-weight="bold">Plan estratégico</text><line x1="180" y1="96" x2="180" y2="112" stroke="#007D81" stroke-width="2.5"/><line x1="82" y1="112" x2="274" y2="112" stroke="#007D81" stroke-width="2.5"/><line x1="82" y1="112" x2="82" y2="128" stroke="#007D81" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#v1)"/><line x1="178" y1="112" x2="178" y2="128" stroke="#007D81" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#v1)"/><line x1="274" y1="112" x2="274" y2="128" stroke="#007D81" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#v1)"/><rect x="40" y="130" width="84" height="38" rx="5" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#99CBCD" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="82" y="154" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Calibri, Carlito, Segoe UI, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#111111">Objetivo</text><rect x="136" y="130" width="84" height="38" rx="5" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#99CBCD" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="178" y="154" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Calibri, Carlito, Segoe UI, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#111111">Inici